# Running the example from this directory writes here: the boundary input table
# the runner materializes, and one `runs/<timestamp>/` directory per run holding
# that run's artifacts, its log, its provenance, its RO-Crate manifest, and
# copies of the plan and the inputs. All of it is reproducible from the one
# command in the README, so none of it belongs in the repository.
digits.csv
runs/
